# REF_Box_4stud — the Fawn Rush scale gate
#
# A 4 x 4 x 4 stud cube, base sitting exactly on y = 0, centred on x/z.
# docs/06 §5.2.1: import this first. In Studio it must measure exactly 4.00 studs and match one
# tile. If it does not, every asset in the project is the wrong scale — stop and fix the export
# settings before importing anything else.
#
# Generated by hand (it is a cube); it is deliberately tiny and dependency-free.

mtllib REF_Palette.mtl

v -2.0000 0.0000 -2.0000
v -2.0000 0.0000 2.0000
v 2.0000 0.0000 2.0000
v 2.0000 0.0000 -2.0000
v -2.0000 4.0000 -2.0000
v -2.0000 4.0000 2.0000
v 2.0000 4.0000 2.0000
v 2.0000 4.0000 -2.0000

usemtl REF_Slate

# bottom (-Y)
f 1 4 3 2
# top (+Y)
f 5 6 7 8
# front (+Z)
f 2 3 7 6
# back (-Z)
f 1 5 8 4
# right (+X)
f 3 4 8 7
# left (-X)
f 2 6 5 1
